Third-party data attribution
============================

This project's `build_reference.py` can read pattern definitions from
cwtools/cwtools-eu4-config (MIT License):
  https://github.com/cwtools/cwtools-eu4-config

Those files are NOT bundled or redistributed here. The user supplies their own
checkout locally. Only aggregate name lists derived from the user's own game
installation are produced, and those stay on the user's machine
(see .gitignore / package.json "files").

This project contains NO game assets. No vanilla Europa Universalis IV files,
textures, audio, localisation text, or derived data are included or shipped.
